@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> User Initiates Search : User starts search
User Initiates Search --> Process Search Query : System processes query
Process Search Query --> Generate Personalized Recommendations : System generates recommendations
Generate Personalized Recommendations --> Display Recommendations : Recommendations available
Generate Personalized Recommendations --> No Recommendations Available : No recommendations available
Display Recommendations --> [*] : User finishes
No Recommendations Available --> [*] : User finishes
Display Recommendations --> User Initiates Search : User continues browsing
@enduml
